{"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swift\/array\/partition(by:)-33stm"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Array"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Array\/partition(by:)-33stm","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Reorders the elements of the collection such that all the elements"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that match the given predicate are after all the elements that don’t"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"match."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"mutating","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"partition","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"by"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"belongsInSecondPartition"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/BidirectionalCollection\/Element","text":"Element","preciseIdentifier":"s:SK7ElementQa"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Bool","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rethrows","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/BidirectionalCollection\/Index","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Index","preciseIdentifier":"s:SK5IndexQa"}]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"belongsInSecondPartition","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A predicate used to partition","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the collection. All elements satisfying this predicate are ordered","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"after all elements not satisfying it.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The index of the first element in the reordered collection"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that matches ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"belongsInSecondPartition"},{"type":"text","text":". If no elements in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"collection match "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"belongsInSecondPartition"},{"type":"text","text":", the returned index is"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"equal to the collection’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"endIndex","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"After partitioning a collection, there is a pivot index ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"p"},{"type":"text","text":" where"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"no element before "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"p"},{"type":"text","text":" satisfies the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"belongsInSecondPartition"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"predicate and every element at or after ","type":"text"},{"code":"p","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" satisfies"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"belongsInSecondPartition"},{"text":". This operation isn’t guaranteed to be","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stable, so the relative ordering of elements within the partitions might"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"change."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In the following example, an array of numbers is partitioned by a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"predicate that matches elements greater than 30."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["var numbers = [30, 40, 20, 30, 30, 60, 10]","let p = numbers.partition(by: { $0 > 30 })","\/\/ p == 5","\/\/ numbers == [30, 10, 20, 30, 30, 60, 40]"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"numbers"},{"type":"text","text":" array is now arranged in two partitions. The first"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"partition, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"numbers[..<p]"},{"type":"text","text":", is made up of the elements that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are not greater than 30. The second partition, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"numbers[p...]"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is made up of the elements that "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"are"}]},{"type":"text","text":" greater than 30."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let first = numbers[..<p]","\/\/ first == [30, 10, 20, 30, 30]","let second = numbers[p...]","\/\/ second == [60, 40]"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Note that the order of elements in both partitions changed."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"That is, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"40"},{"type":"text","text":" appears before "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"60"},{"type":"text","text":" in the original collection,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"but, after calling "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"partition(by:)"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"60"},{"type":"text","text":" appears before "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"40"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O("},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}]},{"type":"text","text":"), where "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is the length of the collection."}]}],"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Complexity"}]}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","extendedModule":"Swift","externalID":"s:SMsSKRzrlE9partition2by5IndexSlQzSb7ElementSTQzKXE_tKF::SYNTHESIZED::s:Sa","roleHeading":"Instance Method","role":"symbol","platforms":[{"introducedAt":"8.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"iOS"},{"introducedAt":"8.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"iPadOS"},{"introducedAt":"13.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"Mac Catalyst"},{"introducedAt":"10.10","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"macOS"},{"introducedAt":"9.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"tvOS"},{"introducedAt":"1.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"visionOS"},{"introducedAt":"2.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"watchOS"}],"conformance":{"conformancePrefix":[{"text":"Conforms when","type":"text"}],"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Self"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"BidirectionalCollection"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"availabilityPrefix":[{"text":"Available when","type":"text"}]},"modules":[{"name":"Standard Library"}],"title":"partition(by:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"partition","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"text":"by","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"text":"Element","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SK7ElementQa"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"rethrows"